# Student Notes Manager

A simple MERN stack application built to help students manage their notes with a clean and responsive UI.

## Features
- Add a note with title, subject and content
- Display all saved notes
- Search notes by title or subject
- Edit a note
- Delete a note after confirmation
- Show empty-state message when no notes exist
- Show success and error messages
- Save notes in MongoDB Atlas using Mongoose

## Tech Stack
- React.js with Vite
- Node.js and Express.js
- MongoDB Atlas + Mongoose
- Bootstrap 5
- Axios

